# TDOC: the README's "LIVE as a launchpad" section. The PADS layer launches clips at their
# quantize point; tap the playing clip to stop it; HOME + tap launches now; SEL switches to the
# PLAY layer. FX shows the punch effects and role mutes; HOME+FX resets them. EDIT opens LIVE
# SETUP (assign keys, launch default, stage lock, MIDI, clock in, the take). REC records the
# take; the take card plays it; holding REC clears it with a ring.
# Shots: a queued pad, the PLAY layer, the FX layer, LIVE SETUP, assign keys, the take card and
# the clear-take ring.
wait 300
newsong 1
# --- enter LIVE and start the transport ---
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
wait 1400
expect mode 1
expect layer 0
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
wait 1400

# --- PADS: tap a pad; it waits for its quantize point and blinks ---
tapkey 0
expect liveque0 0
shot readme_live_queued.png
wait-bar 1
expect liveclip0 0
# --- tap the playing clip to stop it (also quantized) ---
tapkey 0
expect livestop0 1
wait-bar 1
expect liveclip0 -1
# --- HOME + tap launches immediately ---
press HOME
tapkey 1
release HOME
wait 250
expect liveclip0 1

# --- SEL toggles the PLAY layer; the keys then play the focused role ---
tap SEL
expect layer 1
shot readme_live_play.png
tap SEL
expect layer 0

# --- the punch FX layer: tap to latch, hold for momentary; upper keys mute roles ---
press FX
wait 100
shot readme_live_fx.png
key w0 down
wait 100
key w0 up
wait 100
expect fxlatch0 1
key b0 down
wait 100
key b0 up
wait 100
expect fxmute0 1
release FX
wait 1400
expect fxlatch0 1
# HOME + FX resets every effect
press HOME
tap FX
release HOME
expect fxlatch0 0

# --- record the take: REC arms it from the next bar ---
tap REC
wait-bar 1
expect takerec 1
tapkey 2
wait-bar 1
tap REC
wait-bar 2
expect takehas 1
expect takestate 0

# --- LIVE SETUP: EDIT opens the list ---
tap EDIT
wait 200
shot readme_live_setup.png
# assign keys: SEL opens the screen; hold a key, turn PRESETS, release to commit
tap SEL
wait 200
key 0 down
turn PRESET 5 80
shot readme_live_assign.png
key 0 up
wait 100
expect keyclip0 5
wait 1400
tap HOME
# the Take row: SEL opens the take card; SEL plays it, PLAY stops it
turn SELECT 6
tap SEL
wait 300
shot readme_live_take.png
tap SEL
wait 400
expect takeplaying 1
tap PLAY
wait 1400
expect takeplaying 0
# hold REC to clear the take: the ring fills over 1.5 s
press REC
wait 750
shot readme_live_clear_take.png
wait 1000
release REC
wait 100
expect takehas 0
tap EDIT
wait 200
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
wait 1400
expect mode 0
dump readme_live.json
